{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Science, Old and New"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Robots Are Coming"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le15ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do   something. In that condition, something else will happen."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you choose the robotic system </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> it will increase the chance of a successful operation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If they have the procedure,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">they may develop serious complications following it. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " I have been offered an opening for the removal of my cancerous prostate if I opt for a robotic surgical system. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " What are my chances of recovery if I go ahead with it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I understand correctly, you are more worried about a robotic surgeon than by the surgery itself."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Modal Verbs in the Passive Voice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use modal verbs to add meaning to other verbs.  They come before the dictionary form (infinitive without <span class=\"italic\">to</span>) of the main verb. <br/>Modal verbs can add meaning connected with certainty or obligation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use modal verbs in the passive voice. <br/>You use the passive voice when you want to focus on the \"receiver\" of the action, rather than the \"doer\" of the action. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is the structure of a passive sentence:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + To be + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">How safely <span class=\"strong\">is</span> procedure <span class=\"strong\">done</span> with a robot at the helm? </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can add a modal verb before the To be."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + modal + To be + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">How safely <span class=\"strong\">can</span> the procedure <span class=\"strong\"> be done</span> with a robot at the helm? </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here the sentence now has an additional meaning of possibility, thanks to the modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The surgery could not be performed unless I embarked on a weight loss program immediately. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The operation cannot be considered anything but essential."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It can be reached only with difficulty in overweight patients."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Your recovery rate could even be higher than for a patient who is not overweight. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to seek "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go in search or quest of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I want to seek a second opinion"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about robotic surgeons."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "helm"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in charge or in the position of a leader"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How safely can the procedure be done with a robot at the helm?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cut open"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to dissect"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The idea of being cut open and operated on by a robot frightens me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "removal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of taking somebody/something away from a particular place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have been offered an opening for the removal of my cancerous prostate. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "procedure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "A  manner of proceeding; a way of performing or effecting something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If they have the procedure, they may develop serious complications following it. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pelvis"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the large circular bones that support the lower part of your back and are connected to the bones of your legs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The prostate is located deep within the pelvis."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "within"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in or into the interior or inner part; inside"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Within the body is the skeleton."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overweight"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "too heavy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your recovery rate could even be higher than for a patient who is not overweight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "complication"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a difficulty or problem"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:   The robotic system will decrease the chance of complications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le15ob09aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Go online or to a library and look up robots used in medicine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make notes on what you find out. Try to find 2 or 3 examples."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short summary on each of the robots and read it to a partner in class. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's summaries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss the uses of robots in medicine and what you think about it."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find out about robots used in medicine. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write up summaries on my findings."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my summaries with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my thoughts on using robots in medicine."}], 